<template>
    <heading>Edit Article Dialog</heading>
    <keywords><li>article editor</li><li>dialog</li><li>save</li></keywords>
    <section data-lp5-kind="explanation">
        <p>The editor presents the selected article as XML source. The draft stays in the dialog until Save; Cancel or Escape discards it. Save is enabled only after a change. Model validation errors are shown in the dialog so the user can correct the draft without overwriting the stored article.</p>
        <p>This first editor does not change the article's child links. Reordering or creating project-tree links needs its own operation.</p>
    </section>
    <section data-lp5-kind="code">
        <name>EditArticle</name>
        <code><![CDATA[
<template id="EditArticle">
    <style>
        .EditArticle:modal { max-width: min(80vw, 64rem); }
        .EditArticle h2 { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; font-size: 1.25rem; }
        .EditArticle h2 code { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: normal; }
        .EditArticle textarea {
            box-sizing: border-box; width: min(75vw, 60rem); height: min(65vh, 42rem);
            font: 0.9rem/1.4 ui-monospace, monospace; white-space: pre; tab-size: 4;
        }
        .EditArticle [role="alert"] { color: #a00; white-space: pre-wrap; }
        .EditArticle .dialog-buttons {
            display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 0.75rem;
        }
    </style>
    <dialog id="EditArticle-dialog" class="EditArticle" aria-labelledby="EditArticle-title">
        <h2 id="EditArticle-title">Edit Article <code id="EditArticle-filename"></code></h2>
        <label for="EditArticle-source">Article XML source</label>
        <textarea id="EditArticle-source" spellcheck="false" wrap="off" aria-describedby="EditArticle-error"></textarea>
        <p id="EditArticle-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
        <div class="dialog-buttons">
            <button id="EditArticle-cancel" type="button">Cancel</button>
            <button id="EditArticle-save" type="button" disabled>Save</button>
        </div>
        <script>
            const filename = ctx.filename;
            const source = elementByID["EditArticle-source"];
            const save = elementByID["EditArticle-save"];
            const cancel = elementByID["EditArticle-cancel"];
            elementByID["EditArticle-filename"].textContent = filename;
            source.value = ctx.source;
            source.defaultValue = ctx.source;
            source.addEventListener("input", () => {
                save.disabled = source.value === ctx.source;
                elementByID["EditArticle-error"].hidden = true;
            });
            save.addEventListener("click", () => {
                save.disabled = true;
                source.disabled = true;
                cancel.disabled = true;
                window.LP5.controller.dispatch({
                    name: "SaveArticle", filename, text: source.value
                });
            });
            cancel.addEventListener("click", () =>
                window.LP5.controller.dispatch({ name: "CancelEditArticle" }));
            const dialog = elementByID["EditArticle-dialog"];
            dialog.addEventListener("cancel", event => {
                event.preventDefault();
                window.LP5.controller.dispatch({ name: "CancelEditArticle" });
            });
            return dialog;
        </script>
    </dialog>
</template>
]]></code>
    </section>
</template>
